+| `saleor` | product mutation/query/translation tests | Regression coverage for storage, schema, translation, validation, and authorization. |
+| `saleor-dashboard` | product fragments, form data/types/components, update variables, translation fragments/mutations/section builder | Staff canonical input and per-locale override through generated GraphQL types. |
+| `react-storefront` | `ProductDetails.graphql`, product contract/mapper, `product-attributes.tsx`, locale messages | PDP data, locale fallback, and conditional labeled presentation. |
